<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch ups Guangzhou Inv warrants.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch ups Guangzhou Inv warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Monday it has issued a further 500 million American-style call warrants on shares of Guangzhou Investment Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$3.175	 PREMIUM	    12.19 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.092	 GEARING	    3.97X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	28.NOV.97	SETTLEMENT DATE  29.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG	LISTING DATE     30.APR.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE PRICE HK$3.65	  MIN EXER LOT     20,000</p>
<p> NOTES	     PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
